<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Swift Transport started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Swift Transport started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch analyst Jeffrey Kauffman confirmed he started coverage of Swift Transportation Co Inc with near-term accumulate and long-term buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-15 month target price of 25.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 19-13/16 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
